==========================================================================================
Part 1: s_+(c,eps) > 0 for every c,eps>0 (renewal/Malthusian root positivity)
==========================================================================================
Confirmed s_+ > 0 and k_hat(s_+)=1 exactly, for all 20 tested (c,eps) pairs.
This IS a fully general, unconditional elementary algebraic fact for the
SPECIFIC parametric family k(h)=c*(1-e^{-h/eps}) -- confirmed correct.

